BLE Server Client Communication
===============================
Kyber Exchange
---------------
Server, Client -> generate pub and priv key for signature
Server, Client -> preconfigured with server sign pub key, client sign pub key
Server --> generate pub kyber key, priv kyber key
Server --> INDICATE pub kyber key to client ALONG WITH SIGNATURE
client --> use enc(pub kyber key) to generate shared secret  and ciphertext
client --> WRITE ciphertext on server ALONG WITH SIGNATURE
server --> use dec(priv kyber key, ciphertext) to get shared secret

now then the shared secret is used for every communication use aes

